ooltip#touch-long-press","), the same as the ",[336,341,343],{"href":342},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox#label","checkbox",". The description wraps: without one the height matches an input, and with one the switch grows while its first line still lines up with fields next to it.",[346,347],"component-example",{"name":348},"switch-basic",[321,350,351],{"id":309},"Action",[300,353,354,356],{},[303,355,309],{}," runs after toggling, receives the new value and may return a Promise. Use it for settings that are saved through an API as soon as they change, such as enabling an account or notifications.",[346,358],{"name":359},"switch-action",[361,362,363,386],"table",{},[364,365,366],"thead",{},[367,368,369,373,375,380],"tr",{},[370,371,372],"th",{},"Stage",[370,374,152],{},[370,376,377],{},[303,378,379],{},"v-model",[370,381,382,385],{},[303,383,384],{},"change"," event",[387,388,389,404,418,430],"tbody",{},[367,390,391,395,398,401],{},[392,393,394],"td",{},"Pending",[392,396,397],{},"Shows the new value, loading and disabled",[392,399,400],{},"Unchanged",[392,402,403],{},"Not emitted",[367,405,406,409,412,415],{},[392,407,408],{},"Success",[392,410,411],{},"Keeps the new value, loading and disabled end",[392,413,414],{},"Updated to the new value",[392,416,417],{},"Emitted",[367,419,420,423,426,428],{},[392,421,422],{},"Failure",[392,424,425],{},"Goes back to the old value, loading and disabled end",[392,427,400],{},[392,429,403],{},[367,431,432,435,438,440],{},[392,433,434],{},"Error",[392,436,437],{},"Same as failure",[392,439,400],{},[392,441,403],{},[443,444,445,462,479,487],"ul",{},[446,447,448,451,452,455,456,458,459,314],"li",{},[449,450,408],"strong",{},": only returning ",[303,453,454],{},"false"," (or a Promise resolving to ",[303,457,454],{},") counts as a failure. Any other value is a success, including no return value as in ",[303,460,461],{},"async () => { await save(value) }",[446,463,464,467,468,471,472,475,476,478],{},[449,465,466],{},"Errors",": when the action throws, the switch reverts the same way and the error is thrown again, for the global error handler or the console. To notify the user, ",[303,469,470],{},"try","\u002F",[303,473,474],{},"catch"," inside the action, show a message and return ",[303,477,454],{},", as in the example above.",[446,480,481,483,484,486],{},[449,482,394],{},": the switch is disabled, so the action is not called twice. If the page changes ",[303,485,379],{}," while pending, the page's value wins and is not overwritten when the action finishes.",[446,488,489,494,495,497,498,314],{},[449,490,491,492],{},"Without ",[303,493,309],{},", ",[303,496,379],{}," updates right after toggling, the same as ",[303,499,313],{},[300,501,502,503,506,507,510,511,314],{},"The ",[303,504,505],{},"SwitchAction"," and ",[303,508,509],{},"SwitchValue"," types can be imported from ",[303,512,513],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Fcomponents\u002FShuoSwitch.vue",[321,515,517],{"id":516},"on-and-off-values","On and off values",[300,519,520,506,523,526,527,506,530,532,533,471,536,539],{},[303,521,522],{},"true-value",[303,524,525],{},"false-value"," are the bound values when on and off, ",[303,528,529],{},"true",[303,531,454],{}," by default. Change them when the back end uses ",[303,534,535],{},"Y",[303,537,538],{},"N","; the action receives these values too.",[346,541],{"name":542},"switch-values",[321,544,546],{"id":545},"size-and-states","Size and states",[300,548,549,550,553,554,557,558,561,562,565,566,569,570,573,574,577,578,581,582,586],{},"When ",[303,551,552],{},"size"," is not set, it follows the ",[303,555,556],{},"UFormField"," size and the site-wide setting, ",[303,559,560],{},"lg"," built in, the same as the other input components. Without a description, the switch height matches an input of the same size (24 to 40px for ",[303,563,564],{},"xs"," to ",[303,567,568],{},"xl","), so it lines up with other fields in the same row. ",[303,571,572],{},"loading"," shows a loading icon and disables the swit